<div class="content">
    <h2>⏰ Reminder: {{className}} Starts Soon!</h2>
    
    <p>Hello {{studentName}},</p>
    
    <p>This is a friendly reminder that your class <strong>{{className}}</strong> is coming up soon.</p>
    
    <div style="background: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.7); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #4f46e5;">Class Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Date & Time:</strong> {{classDateTime}}</p>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> {{duration}} minutes</p>
        <p><strong>Instructor:</strong> {{instructorName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting Link:</strong> <a href="{{meetingLink}}" style="color: #4f46e5;">Join Class</a></p>
        {{#if materials}}
        <p><strong>Materials to Review:</strong> {{materials}}</p>
        {{/if}}
    </div>
    
    <p>To ensure the best experience, please:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0;">
        <li>Test your audio and video before the class starts</li>
        <li>Join 5 minutes early to resolve any technical issues</li>
        <li>Have your materials ready</li>
        <li>Find a quiet, well-lit space</li>
    </ul>
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        <a href="{{meetingLink}}" class="button" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%);">
            Join Class Now
        </a>
    </div>
    
    <p>If you can't make it, please let us know at least 24 hours in advance to reschedule.</p>
    
    <p>We look forward to seeing you in class!</p>
    
    <p>Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
    
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 30px;">
        This is an automated reminder. To manage your notification preferences, visit your <a href="{{notificationSettingsUrl}}" style="color: #4f46e5;">account settings</a>.
    </p>
</div>
